{"id":2963,"date":"2025-08-19T12:11:52","date_gmt":"2025-08-19T17:11:52","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.arkhamhorror.com\/?post_type=news&#038;p=2963"},"modified":"2025-08-20T08:55:29","modified_gmt":"2025-08-20T13:55:29","slug":"the-complete-terror-at-the-end-of-time-is-available-now","status":"publish","type":"news","link":"https:\/\/www.arkhamhorror.com\/news\/the-complete-terror-at-the-end-of-time-is-available-now\/","title":{"rendered":"The complete Terror at the End of Time is available now"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p>The complete series of <em>Terror at the End of Time <\/em>from Dark Horse Comics has been collected into a trade paperback and is available now wherever you buy your comics and graphic novels. The trade paperback collects all four issues of the mini-series, featuring Jenny Barnes and Joe Diamond as the pair search for Jenny&#8217;s missing sister, Izzie. The series is written by Cullen Bunn, with art by Andrea Mutti, and cover art from Rafael Albuquerque.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>From Dark Horse:<\/p>\n\n\n<div class=\"lazyblock-block-quote-36ASk wp-block-lazyblock-block-quote\"><blockquote class=\"text-sand-white text-left px-8 md:pl-16 py-16 space-y-4 max-w-xl mx-auto\">\n    <p><p><strong>Eisner-nominated master of horror Cullen Bunn brings Arkham Horror\u2014the hair-raising 1920s mystery and adventure game\u2014to the world of comics with <em>Arkham Horror: The Terror at the End of Time<\/em>.<\/strong><\/p>\n<div class=\"tiFieldSet\">\n<div class=\"tiFieldLabel\" title=\"upd_ti_keynote\">Life was all just one big game to adventuring socialite Jenny Barnes. But Jenny\u2019s world turned topsy-turvy when she and her sister Izzie were attacked by a dangerous cult. Although Jenny thwarted the cultists sacrificial endeavors and battled the eldritch monsters at their command, the high priestess Abigail Olmstead fled\u2014and took Izzie with her.<\/div>\n<div class=\"tiFieldValue\">\n<div class=\"tiFieldValueText\"><br \/>Desperate to find her sister, Jenny seeks the help of private investigator Joe Diamond. Joe may not understand her story, but he understands loss. Together, Joe and Jenny will follow a perilous path\u2014fighting unimaginable horrors, journeying to strange worlds, and risking their lives and sanity\u2014in search of Izzie. But the greatest terror awaits them somewhere far beyond the town of Arkham, Massachusetts\u2026<br \/><br \/>Collects\u00a0<em>Arkham Horror: The Terror at the End of Time<\/em>\u00a0#1\u2013#4.<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/p>\n    <cite><\/cite>\n<\/blockquote><\/div>\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/www.arkhamhorror.com\/image-converter?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.svc.asmodee.net%2Fproduction-arkhamhorror%2Fuploads%2F2025%2F08%2FDark-Horse-TPB_comic-pages-1-1024x720.jpg&amp;attachment_id=2965\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-2965\"\/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p>As well as the complete comic series, the trade paperback collects the bonus material from all four issues of the comic, including a parallel Investigator card for Jenny for use in <em>Arkham Horror: The Card Game<\/em>, a church basement encounter and map for <em>Arkham Horror: The Roleplaying Game<\/em>, the opening passages of the mini-gamebook adventure <em>The Magpie &amp; The Bat<\/em>, and more.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>To find out more, <a href=\"https:\/\/www.darkhorse.com\/Books\/3012-065\/Arkham-Horror-The-Terror-at-the-End-of-Time-TPB\">visit the Dark Horse website<\/a>, or pick up a copy wherever you find comics and graphic novels.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><em>A previous version of this article incorrectly mentioned a parallel Investigator card for Roland Banks. The trade paperback includes a parallel Investigator card for Jenny Barnes only.<\/em><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><\/p>\n","protected":false},"featured_media":2951,"parent":0,"template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"key-tag":[17,35,36],"class_list":["post-2963","news","type-news","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","key-tag-bo